<resources>
    <string name="app_name">Ma Collection WCF</string>

    <!-- Onboarding (first launch tutorial) -->
    <string name="onboarding_page1_title">Welcome to Ma Collection WCF 🎎</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_text">This app helps you catalog your World Collectable Figure collection (One Piece, Bleach, Dragon Ball, Naruto...), with price estimates.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">📷 Add a figure</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_text">Tap the + button to add a figure: scan a barcode, take a photo, pick one from your gallery, or enter everything manually.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_title">📚 Encyclo</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_text">Browse the figure catalog and add an entry straight to your collection or wishlist. The built-in catalog grows over time; in the meantime, add your own entries (with a photo) using the + button.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_title">❤️ Wishlist &amp; 💎 Total</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_text">The Wishlist tab lists what you\'re hoping to get next. The Total tab shows the estimated value of your whole collection.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page5_title">💾 Backup</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page5_text">Back up your entire collection (data and photos) to a file you choose where to save, and restore it anytime — handy after a reinstall or a phone change. In settings (gear icon), you can also change the app\'s background image.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page6_title">💡 Tips</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page6_text">In settings (gear icon), a "Tips" tab sums up advice for framing your photos well and filling in your figures accurately by hand.</string>
