    <string name="tips_framing_title">📸 Framing the photo well</string>
    <string name="tips_framing_text">Frame the photo tightly on the figure or its box, flat and facing forward, in good light without glare or blur: the sharper and more readable the box text, the more reliable the automatic name suggestion will be.</string>
    <string name="tips_fields_title">🏷️ Filling in a figure well</string>
    <string name="tips_fields_text">Enter the character, the licence and, if possible, the exact WCF range/wave (visible on the box): this will help you find the right entry in Encyclo and, later, get a more accurate price estimate.</string>
    <string name="tips_price_title">💰 Manually entered price</string>
    <string name="tips_price_text">As long as automatic estimation isn\'t available, enter the price yourself on each entry ("Edit price" button) so your collection\'s total value stays up to date.</string>
